    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "What I can give you safely is: walk when Shift is released; Rockstar sprint while Shift is held; crouching always wins, so there is no sneak-run; and three independent hot-reloaded rate scalars for walk, sneak, and sprint. The supported range is 0.10-1.15 for each gait. What this native cannot do is set metres-per-second speeds, make walk and sprint equal from equal numbers, or remove Rockstar's roughly one-third-second sprint-to-walk blend without fighting the animation graph. I removed the misleading base-times-multiplier controls instead of keeping settings that cannot mean what they say.",
